### H4: Wave phase lag sets whether the body travels or spins

WHEN all five inputs are unit sines at 1.5 Hz with phase lag ph per channel index, THE system SHALL end with heading within 30 deg for ph = 0, and x between 0.3 and 0.5 m for ph = 2.

```prediction
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "heading"
range = [-30, 30]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a1 = 0
a = 1
f = 1.5
ph = 0

[[prediction]]
id = "P2"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.3, 0.5]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a1 = 0
a = 1
f = 1.5
ph = 2
```
